"<color=#C8C8C8>Static emplacement: turret control only, transported by helicopter sling</color>\nA Laser Air Defence System capable of destroying small calibre aerial munitions."
"<color=#C8C8C8>Static emplacement: turret control only, transported by helicopter sling</color>\nAn air-deployable Fire Control system for improving the targeting of air defence batteries."
"<color=#C8C8C8>Static emplacement: turret control only, transported by helicopter sling</color>\nAn air-transportable, self-contained anti-air 35mm gun turret and optical tracking system. Fully self-sufficient once deployed with a range of 5km. For best results, pair with an ammo container to keep it topped up."
"<color=#C8C8C8>Static emplacement: turret control only, transported by helicopter sling</color>\nLong range air defense trailer capable of engaging aerial targets detected by nearby radar trucks"
"<color=#C8C8C8>Static emplacement: turret control only, transported by helicopter sling</color>\nThis trailer is equipped with a 20mm rotary gun to provide point defence against shells, missiles, bombs, and low flying aircraft within a range of approximately 3km."
"<color=#C8C8C8>Static emplacement: turret control only, transported by helicopter sling</color>\nThis transportable air defense missile launcher capable of engaging aerial targets within 15km. It can be deployed by a utility aircraft and obtains target info from a nearby radar."
"<color=#C8C8C8>Static emplacement: turret control only</color>\nA compact, somewhat non-euclidean deployable helipad for deployment and rearmament of rotary-wing aviation. Armed with IRM-S1 and 12.7mm machine gun turrets for self defence."
